# Overview prompt

Create an overview page for the topic below.

Audience: [BEGINNER | INTERMEDIATE | ADVANCED]
Product: [PRODUCT]
Topic: [TOPIC]

Requirements:
- Explain what it is, why it matters, and how it works
- Use conceptual, not procedural, language
- Include practical examples or use cases
- Keep the page focused on one concept or feature
- Add Next steps and Related pages
- Write in a clear, user-focused tone
- Use headings and scannable sections
